steps.text:
Load is only part of it. Reviews list the risk factors seen in athletes [[c:risk-list]]:

- intensified training in winter;
- long-haul travel;
- [low energy availability](g:low-energy-availability);
- high psychological stress and anxiety;
- depression.

The IOC consensus statement adds that poor load management, such as fast jumps in training or a crowded calendar, is itself a risk factor for illness [[c:ioc-load]].
